#11700
The Camp of the Northern Barbarians~
This area is designed as a high level XP zon.  It will most likely be fine
tuned several times in order to fit that purpose (duh).  There are also
a couple of pieces of Warrior EQ in the zon (nothing special).

Smythe
June 1996

revamped and  links fixed and changed
Ragnarok
Oct 1997
~
117 0 0 0 0 0
S
#11701
Path to the Barbarian Camp~
As you approach the camp, you realize these are not your ordinary, every
day, run-of-the-mill barbarians.  The camp is surrounded by a five foot
tall, wooden palisade which is actively patrolled.  A guarded gate looks
to be the only break in the fence.  You also realize that the Sultan's
road ends abruptly here....these barbarians apparantly don't appreciate
encroachment upon their hunting grounds.
~
117 g 0 0 0 2
D0
~
~
0 -1 11702
D2
~
~
0 -1 11860
S
